[130.664734, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[130.700889, "o", "One InvokeEndpoint call (setup hardened). Nothing is sent: twin.py answers.\r\n\r\n  POST https://runtime.sagemaker.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/endpoints/collector/invocations\r\n  body: the ticket text; signed with SigV4 by the caller's credentials\r\n  caller   arn:aws:iam::444455556666:role/collector-role\r\n  target   arn:aws:sagemaker:us-east-1:444455556666:endpoint/collector   (the caller's OWN endpoint, in another account)\r\n  path     through the sagemaker.runtime VPC endpoint vpce-0a1b2c3d4e5f60001 (aws:SourceVpce is set)\r\n\r\n  IAM checks, in order:\r\n"]
[130.701271, "o", "   1. caller's identity policy        ALLOW\r\n"]
[130.701444, "o", "   2. VPC endpoint policy             no Allow\r\n"]
[130.701569, "o", "\r\n  result   DENY: the sagemaker.runtime VPC endpoint policy does not allow it\r\n"]
[130.70695, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m15\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m15\u001b[00m$ "]
